  "comment": "Hand-crafted from a recorded IssueCards request: Trum-ok/gh-dojo#3 (recorded), cli/cli#2 (its title, author, body and comments replaced with neutral ones), #1 of the missing Trum-ok/no-such-repo-xyz (GitHub's NOT_FOUND at r2, as recorded) and cli/cli#1, a pull request, in one batched request, one aliased repository field per repository.",
